  "variants": null,
  "_note": "ATmega2560. Pin table audited against Microchip DS40002211A. D13 drives the onboard LED (active high). 15 PWM outputs: D2-D13 (Timers 0-4), D44-D46 (Timer 5). 4 UARTs: D0/D1 (UART0), D18/D19 (UART1), D16/D17 (UART2), D14/D15 (UART3). 6 external interrupts: D2(INT4), D3(INT5), D18(INT3), D19(INT2), D20(INT1), D21(INT0). D52=SCK, D51=MOSI, D50=MISO, D53=SS (SPI header not modeled). 16 ADC channels on A0-A15. Too large for breadboard; canvas board part.",
  "footprint": null
